description	"Gamorrean Guard

^2Weaponry:
- Axe
-- ^3Yellow ^7Style Only
-- Saber Defense (2)
-- 1.2x AP DMG
- BlasterPistol (1)
-- 50% More FP DMG

^8Attributes:
- Heavy (Slower Movement Speed)
- Strength (2)

From the planet Gamorr, the Gamorrean species consists of brutish, porcine humanoids who maintain a feudal level of technology, and tolerate a remarkable amount of violence in their everyday activities."
